  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 104.65 Type of waste",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 104.65 “Type of waste” means a category of waste, at least as specific as the following, which describes the belonging waste by its material composition or other distinguishing characteristics:\n\n(a) Asbestos waste;\n\n(b) Ash;\n\n(c) Bulky waste;\n\n(d) Construction and demolition debris;\n\n(e) Hazardous waste;\n\n(f) Household hazardous waste;\n\n(g) Household infectious waste;\n\n(h) Infectious waste;\n\n(i) Municipal solid waste;\n\n(j) Putrescible waste;\n\n(k) Recyclable materials; and\n\n(l) Yard waste.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 104.56) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
